"Redirect expired posts to a specified URL (set per-post in the editor)."
msgstr ""
"Przekierowuj wygasłe wpisy na określony adres URL (ustawiane per wpis w "
"edytorze)."

#: includes/class-mscpe-settings.php:368
msgid "Bulk Scheduling"
msgstr "Planowanie zbiorcze"

#: includes/class-mscpe-settings.php:372
msgid "Default expiry window"
msgstr "Domyślne okno wygaśnięcia"

#: includes/class-mscpe-settings.php:375
